{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x07---barts-girlfriend",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x07 - Bart's Girlfriend",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x07 - Bart's Girlfriend.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:01.913Z",
  "lineCount": 289,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "BART'S GIRLFRIEND",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 4317,
      "endMs": 6317
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Remember, Bart... I mean, Dances in Underwear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 40150,
      "endMs": 42900
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "We take the white man alive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43067,
      "endMs": 44775
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "All right, Thinks Too Much. It shall be so.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44942,
      "endMs": 48108
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Keep your eyes peeled for Injuns. I mean, Native Americans.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49567,
      "endMs": 52983
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "They're after us because we gave them blankets infected with cooties.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53150,
      "endMs": 56483
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "I ate all my caps.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56692,
      "endMs": 58650
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Throw down your weapons and kiss the prairie, cow dorks!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 59275,
      "endMs": 62525
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Why do we have to play this corny old game anyway?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64567,
      "endMs": 67483
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "I brought my jacks!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67650,
      "endMs": 69400
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "I got twosies!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70192,
      "endMs": 72108
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "That's not fair, Nelson. They didn't have the Killmatic 3000 back then.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 76900,
      "endMs": 80483
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Hey, records from that era are spotty at best.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80692,
      "endMs": 84358
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Bart! Lisa! Time for church!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89192,
      "endMs": 91650
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Milhouse, time for church!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91817,
      "endMs": 93567
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Shlomo, time for your violin lesson!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 93733,
      "endMs": 96483
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Why the crap do we have to go church anyway?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113525,
      "endMs": 115567
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "You just answered your own question with that commode mouth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115733,
      "endMs": 118525
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Besides, you kids need to learn morals and decency...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118692,
      "endMs": 121275
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "...and how to love your fellow man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 121483,
      "endMs": 123067
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "And with flaming swords, the Aramites did pierce the eyes of their fellow men...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123233,
      "endMs": 128942
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "...and did feast on what flowed forth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 129108,
      "endMs": 131983
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Among whom also we all once conducted ourselves...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 132192,
      "endMs": 135733
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "...in the lusts of our flesh...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 135900,
      "endMs": 137525
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "I'm a troll man I'm a troll man I don't want you playing with something that has such bizarre hair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137692,
      "endMs": 146275
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Awful, awful hair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146525,
      "endMs": 148692
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "And now my daughter, Jessica...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 153567,
      "endMs": 155275
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "...who has just returned from boarding school...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155442,
      "endMs": 157650
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "...will read the same passage I just read.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157817,
      "endMs": 160233
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I noticed a few of you weren't paying attention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 160400,
      "endMs": 163150
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Wow, there is a God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170525,
      "endMs": 173400
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "I'm telling you, the light would work better if it pointed out to sea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177583,
      "endMs": 181833
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Shut up, I know what I'm doing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182000,
      "endMs": 184708
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "I hate the sea and everything in it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 186833,
      "endMs": 189625
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Bye. Bye-bye. Bye-bye. Thank you for choosing our church.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190333,
      "endMs": 193708
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "I've never felt this way about a girl before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194292,
      "endMs": 196458
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "My long search is finally over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196917,
      "endMs": 200083
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Hi, I'm Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206167,
      "endMs": 207792
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "I was incredibly moved by your reading.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207958,
      "endMs": 210583
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I don't think God's words have ever sounded so plausible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210750,
      "endMs": 213958
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Thanks, Art.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214167,
      "endMs": 216250
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I have to go over here now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216500,
      "endMs": 219125
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Don't be so hard on yourself, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223208,
      "endMs": 225000
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "It's not your fault Jessica doesn't like you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 225167,
      "endMs": 227375
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Is it my hair? My overbite?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227542,
      "endMs": 229333
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "The fact that I've worn the same clothes for the last four years?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229500,
      "endMs": 232583
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "No, Bart. I just think you and Jessica are too different to get along.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232792,
      "endMs": 236750
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "She's a sweet, kind reverend's daughter, and you're the devil's cabana boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 237625,
      "endMs": 242083
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Good. Very good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246000,
      "endMs": 248375
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Ralph, Jesus did not have wheels.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248542,
      "endMs": 250750
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Bart Simpson? Yes, ma'am.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253458,
      "endMs": 255417
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "I'd like to return to your wonderful Sunday school, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255583,
      "endMs": 258708
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "But, Bart, we banned you from Sunday school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258875,
      "endMs": 261333
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "You were happy. We were happy. Everybody was happy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261542,
      "endMs": 264958
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Particularly the hamster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265125,
      "endMs": 266792
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "I've changed my ways.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269750,
      "endMs": 271417
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Please give me another chance, ma'am.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 271625,
      "endMs": 273833
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "All right, Bart. The Bible does teach forgiveness.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 274042,
      "endMs": 277875
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Class, I want you to welcome back our prodigal son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 278042,
      "endMs": 281208
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "What? What's prodigal mean?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 281375,
      "endMs": 283250
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Oh, dear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 283375,
      "endMs": 284667
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "You know, the great thing about Sunday school...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 285000,
      "endMs": 287375
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "...is we're finally learning something we can use.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 287542,
      "endMs": 290125
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Yeah, so true.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 290250,
      "endMs": 291917
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I have to turn my chair this way now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292083,
      "endMs": 295625
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Somehow I gotta convince her I'm a good person.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 297050,
      "endMs": 299925
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "All right, I have to sit here and behave, no matter what.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 300092,
      "endMs": 304133
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Okay, class. We have a special treat today for pass-around.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 304300,
      "endMs": 307467
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "A replica of the slingshot David used to slay Goliath.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 307592,
      "endMs": 311383
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "While you kids are looking at that, I'll just busy myself in this file cabinet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311550,
      "endMs": 315383
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Must fight Satan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320758,
      "endMs": 323800
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Make it up to him...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325092,
      "endMs": 327133
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "...later.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329300,
      "endMs": 331008
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "You know, I was considering staying after school...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332258,
      "endMs": 334717
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "...and helping teacher clean up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334842,
      "endMs": 337300
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Do you ever think anything you don't say?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 337883,
      "endMs": 340592
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "There is just no pleasing a girl like that!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343425,
      "endMs": 346008
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "All that unnecessary behaving.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346175,
      "endMs": 349008
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "I'm all tense through the chestal area. I need relief.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349300,
      "endMs": 353800
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Now, the kilt was only for day-to-day wear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 360467,
      "endMs": 363092
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "In battle, we donned a full-length ball gown covered in sequins.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 363258,
      "endMs": 368050
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "The idea was to blind your opponent with luxury.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369258,
      "endMs": 372467
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "'Tis no more than what God gave me, you Puritan pukes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375508,
      "endMs": 379050
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "That'll hold me, at least till I get my hands on some kind of explosives.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382383,
      "endMs": 386383
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Congratulations, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 391300,
      "endMs": 393092
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "You just fell for our sting and won yourself three months' detention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393258,
      "endMs": 397383
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "There's no such thing as Scotchtoberfest!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397592,
      "endMs": 400633
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "There's not? You used me, Skinner! You used me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400842,
      "endMs": 405425
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Three months?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 406133,
      "endMs": 407925
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Hi, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409717,
      "endMs": 411175
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "I saw the way they set you up. That was really unfair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411383,
      "endMs": 416008
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Wanna have dinner at my house tonight?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417550,
      "endMs": 419633
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Really? Sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 419800,
      "endMs": 422467
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Great. We eat at 7.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 423383,
      "endMs": 425592
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "There's only one thing to do at a moment like this: Strut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426758,
      "endMs": 430383
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "So, Bart, how's school going? Jessica always gets straight A's.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 443092,
      "endMs": 446967
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Well, in my family, grades aren't that important.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447175,
      "endMs": 449675
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "It's what you learn that counts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449842,
      "endMs": 451925
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Six times five! What is it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452092,
      "endMs": 453842
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Actually, numbers don't have much use in my future career: Olympic gold-medal rocket-sled champ!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454258,
      "endMs": 459175
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "I didn't know the rocket sled was an Olympic event.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 459592,
      "endMs": 461925
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Well, no offense, but what you don't know could fill a warehouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462133,
      "endMs": 465383
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Young man, explain yourself!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465592,
      "endMs": 467300
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Sorry. I have kind of a short fuse, which some find charming.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 467467,
      "endMs": 471217
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Speaking of charming, watching Fox last night...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471425,
      "endMs": 474133
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "...I heard a rather amusing story.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474300,
      "endMs": 476675
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "This character named Martin was feeling rather randy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476800,
      "endMs": 479967
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "...and he was heard to remark...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480133,
      "endMs": 481633
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "And don't you ever come near my daughter again!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483758,
      "endMs": 486342
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Never have I heard such gratuitous use of the word \"butt\"!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486508,
      "endMs": 489508
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "But... But... But... Make him stop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489717,
      "endMs": 491425
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "But... But... But... Make him stop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491592,
      "endMs": 493675
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "You're bad, Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 499717,
      "endMs": 502633
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "No, I'm not. I'm really...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503133,
      "endMs": 504425
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Yes, you are. You're bad. And I like it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 504592,
      "endMs": 507092
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "I'm bad to the bone, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507300,
      "endMs": 508842
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Let's go find some fun. But your father said...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508967,
      "endMs": 511717
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "I told the rev I was going to my room to say my prayers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511883,
      "endMs": 515300
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Smart, beautiful and a liar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515925,
      "endMs": 519717
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "So much better than that Sarah, plain and tall.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519883,
      "endMs": 522800
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Right there! Put that there!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540425,
      "endMs": 542425
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Excellent! You're incredible, Jessica.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 543467,
      "endMs": 545925
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Your throws, your catches, your spirals, your loops.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546133,
      "endMs": 548967
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "It's like the toilet paper is an extension of your body.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 549175,
      "endMs": 552425
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "No way would a minister's daughter go out with you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553883,
      "endMs": 557217
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Oh, yeah? I'll prove it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 557425,
      "endMs": 558925
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Hey, Jessica. Yes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559967,
      "endMs": 562050
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Am I supposed to know you? Jessica, we just...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562217,
      "endMs": 565050
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "That's for besmirching an innocent girl's name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 565217,
      "endMs": 569008
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Why? I'm sorry, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571267,
      "endMs": 574225
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "You know my parents can't find out about us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574433,
      "endMs": 577183
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "And besides, if it's secret, it's even more exciting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577350,
      "endMs": 581892
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "I guess. Hey, you wanna go skateboarding?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582350,
      "endMs": 584642
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Actually, I was hoping I could sit down for just a second.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585475,
      "endMs": 588725
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Come on, it'll be fun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588933,
      "endMs": 591600
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Now I have the energy to do anything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595225,
      "endMs": 597683
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Just give me two minutes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 598683,
      "endMs": 600433
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Jessica, I think this is too steep.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 604058,
      "endMs": 606308
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Bart, you can't trust your perception at this altitude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606517,
      "endMs": 610392
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Actually, if the road surface maintains its integrity...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 616392,
      "endMs": 619142
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "...I just might be able to hold on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619308,
      "endMs": 621142
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "The glue will slow me down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636850,
      "endMs": 638517
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Any glue leaking? No. That glue ain't going nowhere.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638725,
      "endMs": 642058
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Nothing's ever gonna stop me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643675,
      "endMs": 645258
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Oh, no. There goes the glue after all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653508,
      "endMs": 656800
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Fun, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664258,
      "endMs": 666008
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Have you noticed any change in Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674175,
      "endMs": 676217
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "New glasses? No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676425,
      "endMs": 677883
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "He looks like something might be disturbing him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678050,
      "endMs": 680300
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Probably misses his old glasses.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680508,
      "endMs": 682300
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "I guess we could get more involved in Bart's activities.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682508,
      "endMs": 685092
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "But then I'd be afraid of smothering him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685258,
      "endMs": 687508
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Yeah. And then we'd get the chair. That's not what I meant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687675,
      "endMs": 690758
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "It was, Marge. Admit it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690925,
      "endMs": 692383
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Hi. We should get to class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 696258,
      "endMs": 698342
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "What's the hurry? We could get in trouble for being late.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 698550,
      "endMs": 701425
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "You worry too much.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 701550,
      "endMs": 703133
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Come on. If you stay here a while, I'll let you hold my hand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703342,
      "endMs": 707425
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Teamwork! Come on, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714717,
      "endMs": 716258
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "If I don't save the wee turtles, who will?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721342,
      "endMs": 724217
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Save me from the wee turtles! They were too quick for me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 727967,
      "endMs": 732133
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "I can't believe it, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732342,
      "endMs": 733883
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "I'd always thought Jessica was so sweet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 734092,
      "endMs": 736092
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "She's like a Milk Dud, Lis: Sweet on the outside, poison on the inside.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736258,
      "endMs": 740967
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "You gotta give her up. No, no, wait. Hear my plan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741175,
      "endMs": 743925
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Put up with her for seven more years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744300,
      "endMs": 746342
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Then we'll get married.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746508,
      "endMs": 747800
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Once the first baby comes, she's bound to settle down and treat me right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 747967,
      "endMs": 751300
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "After all, I deserve it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 751508,
      "endMs": 752800
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Bart, it's naive to think you can change a person.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753008,
      "endMs": 756008
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Except maybe that boy who works in the library.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 756175,
      "endMs": 759467
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Do you have Go, Dog, Go?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760550,
      "endMs": 762842
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "That's in Juvenile. This is Young Adult.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763008,
      "endMs": 765842
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Well-read and just a little wild.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766050,
      "endMs": 768758
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "If only someone could tame him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769550,
      "endMs": 772175
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "You're right, Lisa. Love isn't about fixing someone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772383,
      "endMs": 775800
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "I'm just gonna give her up cold turkey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 775967,
      "endMs": 778175
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "I'm not gonna talk to her or see her. It's over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 779383,
      "endMs": 782217
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Thanks for the advice, sis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782383,
      "endMs": 784425
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "There. If I can just get through this many days without seeing her...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 794633,
      "endMs": 798008
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "...she should be completely out of my system.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 798175,
      "endMs": 800383
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Okay, day one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 800550,
      "endMs": 803550
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Time for church, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 806967,
      "endMs": 808425
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "I bet your little friend Jessica will be there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808550,
      "endMs": 811300
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Jessica. Bart, be strong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 817342,
      "endMs": 819217
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "You don't need that little hellcat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 819342,
      "endMs": 821050
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Oh, Lis, she's already drawn me to her...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 823175,
      "endMs": 825383
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "...with her beautiful siren song.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 825550,
      "endMs": 828133
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "That's very disturbing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836508,
      "endMs": 838800
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Hey, Bart. What? What's wrong?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839258,
      "endMs": 842258
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Well, Jessica, I don't think we should hang out together anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842425,
      "endMs": 847342
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "You're turning me into a criminal when all I want to be is a petty thug.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 847467,
      "endMs": 851675
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Oh, good. Here comes the collection plate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852592,
      "endMs": 855217
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "\"Thirty cents off Shake �N' Bake.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863133,
      "endMs": 865133
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Homer! We can spare it, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865342,
      "endMs": 867675
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "We've been blessed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867842,
      "endMs": 869175
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "You're right about everything, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 869675,
      "endMs": 872008
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "I have been too reckless.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 872175,
      "endMs": 874175
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "From now on, I am going to settle down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 874383,
      "endMs": 878258
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Jessica, what are you doing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882092,
      "endMs": 883467
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Well, it takes money to start a new life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883675,
      "endMs": 886175
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Stealing from the collection basket is really wrong. Even I know that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886383,
      "endMs": 890008
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Fine. You just lost your cut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890300,
      "endMs": 893092
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "I'll just take that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893758,
      "endMs": 895133
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Everyone turn around and look at this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 897092,
      "endMs": 899592
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "What is it? A Unitarian?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 900717,
      "endMs": 902467
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Now just relax. For once, you didn't do anything wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906050,
      "endMs": 908633
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Just explain yourself and everyone will understand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908758,
      "endMs": 911300
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "L... Took the money? Yes, we know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911508,
      "endMs": 913175
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "He confessed! Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 913342,
      "endMs": 915425
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Stop him! He's headed for the window!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 918300,
      "endMs": 920467
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Son, if you look me in the eye and say you didn't take the collection money...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921450,
      "endMs": 925992
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "...that's all I need.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926158,
      "endMs": 928075
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "I didn't take it. Why, you little...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928450,
      "endMs": 930158
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "How can you lie like that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930325,
      "endMs": 931950
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Homer, stop that! I believe him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932075,
      "endMs": 934533
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Tell me, if he didn't take the money, why is he wearing those fancy clothes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 934742,
      "endMs": 938867
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "That's what he wore to church.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 939033,
      "endMs": 940783
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "How convenient.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940950,
      "endMs": 942492
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Bart, honey, do you know who did take the money?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942658,
      "endMs": 945367
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "No. See, son?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 947742,
      "endMs": 949533
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Telling the truth isn't so bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949742,
      "endMs": 951658
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Boo! Boo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 956575,
      "endMs": 958075
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Why, you little...! Crook!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958242,
      "endMs": 959867
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Thief! Stealer of money from the church!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 960033,
      "endMs": 962117
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "We've gotta talk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966117,
      "endMs": 967408
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Listen, thanks for not turning me in. That was sweet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967617,
      "endMs": 970908
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Well, it seems like if you really care for me, you should come forward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971367,
      "endMs": 974783
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Don't you see? It's because I care for you that I can't come forward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974950,
      "endMs": 978242
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "That doesn't make any sense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979408,
      "endMs": 980742
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Then I just don't feel like it, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980950,
      "endMs": 982783
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Jessica, you're really beautiful, but you are not very nice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982992,
      "endMs": 986825
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "With the way you treat me, why should I protect you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989560,
      "endMs": 991880
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Because if you tell, no one will believe you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992000,
      "endMs": 994920
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Remember, I'm the sweet, perfect minister's daughter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 995080,
      "endMs": 998440
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "And you're just yellow trash.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998600,
      "endMs": 1000040
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "And her hair smells like red Froot Loops.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026300,
      "endMs": 1028675
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Yeah? Well, I eat Froot Loops for breakfast.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028800,
      "endMs": 1032717
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Because of last week's problems...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033050,
      "endMs": 1034717
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "...we'll be taking certain precautions with this week's collection.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034883,
      "endMs": 1037883
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "We shouldn't have let them do this. It can't be helping his self-esteem.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038050,
      "endMs": 1041383
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Now for our offertory reading, Lisa Simpson...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042929,
      "endMs": 1046046
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "...who we'll all be keeping an eye on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046263,
      "endMs": 1048557
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I know most of you have already judged my brother guilty without any proof.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050072,
      "endMs": 1054358
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "But doesn't the Bible teach us \"judge not, lest ye be judged,\" Reverend?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054574,
      "endMs": 1059986
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "I think it may be somewhere towards the back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060159,
      "endMs": 1062540
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "There is someone among us with a guilty conscience.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062756,
      "endMs": 1065224
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "After much soul-searching, I decided it would be wrong of me to name names.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065440,
      "endMs": 1069639
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "But I urge that guilty person here, under the eyes of God...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1069899,
      "endMs": 1074315
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "...to come forward, to confess...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1074445,
      "endMs": 1076522
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "...and save yourself from the torment of your own personal hell!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1076696,
      "endMs": 1081284
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "I smelled some marijuana smoke in Vietnam!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081674,
      "endMs": 1084142
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "I was the one that canceled Star Trek!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1084358,
      "endMs": 1086566
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "I left my Porsche keys inside Mrs. Glick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086739,
      "endMs": 1089899
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "I am talking to the collection-money thief!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090116,
      "endMs": 1092800
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Only you can come forward and end this injustice!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093016,
      "endMs": 1097561
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Oh, what the heck. It was Jessica Lovejoy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1100722,
      "endMs": 1103882
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "If you search her room, I am certain you will find the money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105310,
      "endMs": 1109120
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "To the little girl's room! Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1109293,
      "endMs": 1111587
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "That's the collection money!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113752,
      "endMs": 1115787
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Oh, yeah. Smells like church.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115960,
      "endMs": 1117691
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "I guess it's obvious what's happened here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117908,
      "endMs": 1119986
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Bart Simpson has somehow managed to sneak his bedroom into my house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1120159,
      "endMs": 1124271
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Well, come on! Use your imaginations!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127172,
      "endMs": 1129293
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "No, Dad. I did it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1129510,
      "endMs": 1132843
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "It's your classic cry for attention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1133362,
      "endMs": 1137172
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Well, young lady, I suppose we brought you home...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1137345,
      "endMs": 1139942
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "...from boarding school a little prematurely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1140159,
      "endMs": 1142583
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "I was expelled, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1142800,
      "endMs": 1145007
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Remember the pipe bomb? The glee club brawl?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145180,
      "endMs": 1147258
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Remember the school chapel collection plate?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147432,
      "endMs": 1149726
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "The exploding toilets ring a bell? Come on, Dad, pay attention to me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1149942,
      "endMs": 1154401
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Hello, in there. Hello?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1154574,
      "endMs": 1155960
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "I think you all owe my son an apology.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1156739,
      "endMs": 1160159
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Very sorry. That's okay. Appreciate it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1160419,
      "endMs": 1163059
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "Hi, Jessica. Hi, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1168384,
      "endMs": 1170548
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Come to watch me suffer?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1170765,
      "endMs": 1172410
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "I just wanted to let you know that even though this was a difficult experience...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172670,
      "endMs": 1176522
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "...I really learned a lot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176696,
      "endMs": 1178514
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "I'm a little wiser and a little less naive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178644,
      "endMs": 1182280
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Well, I learned that I can make men do whatever I want.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1182497,
      "endMs": 1187735
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "Well, don't you see, Jessica? Then you really haven't learned...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187908,
      "endMs": 1192107
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Would you finish scrubbing these steps?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192323,
      "endMs": 1194315
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "Will I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194445,
      "endMs": 1196479
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "Hey, Jessica!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1198891,
      "endMs": 1200666
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "Coming!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1200926,
      "endMs": 1202571
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "Poor sucker. It's amazing what some guys will do for a pretty face.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1205731,
      "endMs": 1210450
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "Not me though.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1210623,
      "endMs": 1212095
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "Wait till she sees the second-rate job I do on these stairs. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1212311,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 7
  }
}
